# Figma MCP Skill

**Server:** figma  
**URL:** https://mcp.figma.com/mcp

## When to use

- Reading or inspecting Figma files, frames, or components
- Extracting design tokens, assets, or layout data from Figma
- Syncing design specs with code or documentation
- Any task that requires "get data from Figma" or "read Figma file"

## Usage

Reference this skill with `@mcp-skills/figma` when you need to access Figma designs. Use the exact tool names and parameters exposed by the Figma MCP server; authentication/headers are configured in Cursor.

## Notes

- Server is official Figma MCP; tool names and params follow Figma's API.
- Use for design-to-code or design documentation workflows.
